  next_2: "<b>Publish it.</b> Once, on pypi.org: <i>Publishing</i> → <i>Add a new pending publisher</i> (your repository, workflow <code>publish.yml</code>, environment <code>pypi</code>). Then on GitHub <i>Releases</i> → <i>Draft a new release</i> → a tag like <code>v0.1.0</code> → <i>Publish</i>, and the template's <a href=\"https://github.com/emkay-voice/ovos-skill-hello-example/blob/main/.github/workflows/publish.yml\"><code>publish.yml</code></a> puts it on PyPI. With an entry point, a PyPI package and a release, Klondike calls it <i>Looks Complete</i>.",
